title: The Battle of Geonosis
subtitle: Jedi are trapped on Geonosis. The Senate must decide whether to go to war.
tags: event
view-if: date >= 135 and dooku_movement and not war and not geonosis_seen and ((seceded_total >= 5 and (outer_seceded > 0.02 or midrim_seceded > 0.02)) or seceded_total >= 10 or outer_sep >= 55 or midrim_sep >= 55 or (force_war and date >= 141 and not federal_compact and not (rim_enfranchised and peace_talks >= 2 and dooku_turned)))
max-visits: 1
priority: 5
new-page: true
face-image: img/ev_war.svg
on-arrival: {!
Q.geonosis_seen = 1;
Q.anakin_jedi = Q.anakin_found ? 1 : 0;
Q.crisis_months = 0;
Q.droid_armies = 3.5 + Q.seceded_total / 8 + (Q.tf_droids ? 1 : 0) - (Q.tf_droids_limited ? 1 : 0) - (Q.tf_broken_up ? 0.8 : 0);
Q.fear += 10;
Q.ep_cost = 2 + (Q.mca_result === 'passed' ? 1 : 0);
!}

= The Battle of Geonosis

[? if seceded_total < 5 : Few worlds have actually left the Republic. It does not matter. Someone has armed the Confederacy anyway, and someone wants this war. ?] On Geonosis, the Jedi have discovered a vast droid army being built for the Confederacy. Obi-Wan Kenobi has been captured, and Anakin Skywalker and Padmé Amidala have gone after him. The Jedi Council is sending every Knight it has. They will be massacred without support.

[? if kamino_army : The clone army of Kamino is ready, but the Senate has never authorised it. ?][? if not kamino_army : The clone army was decommissioned. The Republic has only the Judicial Forces ([+ judicial_forces : strength +]) and whatever member worlds will send. ?] [? if mca_result = "oversight" : Under the Caucus's amendment, any army deployed now would answer to a Senate oversight committee. ?]

[? if not rc_chancellor : In an emergency session, a Gungan representative rises to move that the Senate grant the Chancellor **emergency powers** to deploy the army. ?][? if pal_chancellor : Palpatine accepts the suggestion with every appearance of reluctance. ?][? if rc_chancellor : In an emergency session, the Security Bloc moves that the Senate grant **our own Chancellor, [+ chancellor +],** emergency powers to deploy the army. Senator Palpatine, of all people, speaks warmly in favour. The decision is ours. ?]

- @powers_no: [? if rc_chancellor : Our Chancellor declines emergency powers. ?][? if not rc_chancellor : Vote against emergency powers. ?]
- @powers_yes: [? if rc_chancellor : Our Chancellor accepts emergency powers. ?][? if not rc_chancellor : Vote for emergency powers. ?]
- @oversight: Move to deploy the clones under Senate command, without emergency powers.
- @judicials: Send the Judicial Forces and the Defence Pact instead.

@powers_no
subtitle: The Pacifists will be proud.
on-arrival: geo_choice = "no"; pacifist_dissent -= 5; hawk_dissent += 5
go-to: geo_vote

@powers_yes
subtitle: [? if rc_chancellor : The powers would be ours. The Hawks will be relieved; the Pacifists will remember. ?][? if not rc_chancellor : The Hawks will be relieved. ?]
on-arrival: geo_choice = "yes"; hawk_dissent -= 5; pacifist_dissent += 8
go-to: geo_vote

@oversight
view-if: kamino_army and not army_oversight
subtitle: −1 political capital. An army, but answerable to the Senate.
choose-if: capital >= 1 and (senate_resolve >= 2 or rc_in_govt or rc_r >= 15)
unavailable-subtitle: Needs 1 political capital, and either some Senate resolve, a seat in government, or a large Caucus.
on-arrival: capital -= 1; geo_choice = "oversight"
go-to: geo_vote

@judicials
view-if: judicial_forces >= 4 or pact_formed or not kamino_army
subtitle: The Senate keeps control, but our forces are thin.
on-arrival: geo_choice = "judicials"; hawk_dissent -= 2
go-to: geo_vote

@geo_vote
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
var ep = {pal: 1, sec: 0.95, mod: 0.5 + Q.fear / 200, guild: 0.45, ind: 0.5 + Q.fear / 250, rim: 0.4, rfc: 0.3, cis: 0};
if (Q.rc_chancellor) { var follow = Q.geo_choice === 'yes' ? 0.25 : -0.25; for (var gb in ep) if ((Q.govt_blocs || []).indexOf(gb) >= 0) ep[gb] = SW.clamp(ep[gb] + follow, 0, 1); }
var html = '';
Q.geo_outcome = '';
if (Q.geo_choice === 'oversight') {
    var ov = SW.stance(Q, {pal: 0.25, sec: 0.55, mod: 0.65 + Q.fear / 300, guild: 0.45, ind: 0.65, rim: 0.55, rfc: 0.5, cis: 0}, true);
    var v = SW.vote(Q, ov, 1, 'oversight');
    html += SW.voteBanner('Deployment of the clone army under Senate command', v);
    if (v >= 50) { Q.geo_outcome = 'oversight'; Q.army_oversight = 1; Q.navy_loyalty += 12; }
}
if (!Q.geo_outcome && Q.kamino_army) {
    var v2 = SW.vote(Q, ep, Q.geo_choice === 'yes' ? 1 : 0, 'powers');
    html += SW.voteBanner('Emergency powers for the Chancellor', v2);
    if (v2 >= 50) { Q.geo_outcome = 'powers'; Q.emergency_powers += Q.ep_cost; if (Q.rc_chancellor) Q.rc_emergency_taken += Q.ep_cost; }
}
if (!Q.geo_outcome) Q.geo_outcome = 'none';
Q.vote_html = html;
// the war begins either way: the Confederacy will not stand down now
Q.war = 1;
Q.jedi_generals = 1;
if (Q.geo_outcome === 'oversight' || Q.geo_outcome === 'powers') { Q.clones = 5; Q.war_balance = 1; Q.jedi_strength -= 0.5; }
else { Q.clones = 0; Q.war_balance = -2 + Q.judicial_forces * 0.2 + Q.member_forces * 0.2; Q.jedi_strength -= 2; Q.jedi_standing -= 5; }
var idx = Q.parties.indexOf('cis');
if (idx >= 0) {
    Q.parties.splice(idx, 1);
    for (var i = 0; i < SW.REGIONS.length; i++) Q[SW.REGIONS[i] + '_cis'] = 0;
}
Q.clear_hand = 1;
SW.senateSession(Q);
!}

= The Clone Wars Begin

[+ vote_html +]

[? if geo_outcome = "powers" : The Senate grants [? if rc_chancellor : our ?][? if not rc_chancellor : the ?] Chancellor emergency powers, to thunderous applause. Within hours, [+ chancellor +] authorises the creation of the **Grand Army of the Republic**. Clone troopers led by Master Yoda arrive on Geonosis in time to rescue the surviving Jedi. ?][? if geo_outcome = "oversight" : The Senate itself orders the clones into battle, under a standing oversight committee. The Chancellor receives no new powers. Clone troopers arrive on Geonosis in time to rescue the surviving Jedi. ?][? if geo_outcome = "none" : The Senate refuses to hand over its authority. Judicial cruisers and Defence Pact squadrons race to Geonosis and arrive too late for many of the Jedi. The Republic has kept its constitution, but its first battle has been bloody. ?]

The Separatist senators walk out of the rotunda for the last time. The **Clone Wars** have begun.
